            <h3 class="text-2xl font-semibold mb-4">Incident Response Protocol</h3>

            <ol class="list-decimal list-inside mb-6 text-gray-700 space-y-2">
              <li><strong>Detection:</strong> Alarm triggered or suspicious activity observed</li>
              <li><strong>Verification:</strong> Site manager or monitoring service confirms the threat on live video</li>
              <li><strong>Warning:</strong> Audio deterrent activated if safe</li>
              <li><strong>Notification:</strong> Police and site manager alerted</li>
              <li><strong>Documentation:</strong> Save all video evidence</li>
              <li><strong>Response:</strong> Law enforcement or security arrives</li>
              <li><strong>Recovery:</strong> Assess damage, file reports</li>
              <li><strong>Review:</strong> Analyze incident, improve procedures</li>
            </ol>

